because this is major --

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:21.400
I'm on an actual record label
with real stars.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.467
[ Laughter ]
Like the biggest of the big.

00:04:24.467 --> 00:04:26.334
Stunner, Megan Thee Stallion.

00:04:26.334 --> 00:04:29.868
I mean, and I get to debut it.

00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:31.868
It's out at midnight, so,
whatever you stream music on,

00:04:31.868 --> 00:04:33.901
